                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "344e523d-2845-35f4-9154-30b7b53533b3",
                        "entry_id": "bc292202-0df5-320c-8ddd-79c9f77efe3c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "свойство по значению прилагательного плотный"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0a1c3c7c-b8f1-41d9-ab22-d9315c22b9ea",
                                "sense_id": "344e523d-2845-35f4-9154-30b7b53533b3",
                                "text": "А в нутре у меня никакой нет плотности."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fefd0505-de4b-40c5-8d0a-64c7cc5676f8",
                                "sense_id": "344e523d-2845-35f4-9154-30b7b53533b3",
                                "text": "Теперь только Пьер понял всю силу жизненности человека и спасительную силу перемещения внимания, вложенную в человека, подобную тому спасительному клапану в паровиках, который выпускает лишний пар, как только плотность его превышает известную норму."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5bd045c0-0ad8-3b5c-b5e9-b851cc8fb7cd",
                        "entry_id": "bc292202-0df5-320c-8ddd-79c9f77efe3c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "физ. отношение массы тела к его объёму"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1101a59b-c63a-4b78-ad6f-26f5a15f1b0d",
                                "sense_id": "5bd045c0-0ad8-3b5c-b5e9-b851cc8fb7cd",
                                "text": "Как правило, при уменьшении температуры плотность увеличивается, но есть вещества, чья плотность ведет себя иначе, например, вода, бронза и чугун."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "84d693fc-2e65-3cc8-80f2-48999ba99449",
                        "entry_id": "bc292202-0df5-320c-8ddd-79c9f77efe3c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "спец. отношение количества чего-либо к определенной единице пространства"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b6265323-a391-4567-829f-45c9074dfc84",
                                "sense_id": "84d693fc-2e65-3cc8-80f2-48999ba99449",
                                "text": "Если хотите сформировать душистый малиновый ковёр, то посадите растения с плотностью 1—2 саженца на 1 квадратный метр."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d66fb0b6-9d94-4299-8476-280c69589e50",
                                "sense_id": "84d693fc-2e65-3cc8-80f2-48999ba99449",
                                "text": "Плотность вязки: 14 столбиков = 10 сантиметров."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f480396d-4d0e-4637-98be-315cdc575acc",
                        "source_entry_id": "bc292202-0df5-320c-8ddd-79c9f77efe3c",
                        "target_lang_word": "density",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "density",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08720895-cbea-3048-9ae0-112f36b3c05a",
                                        "entry_id": "8423399f-12d7-3e30-aab6-031c2c39175b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A measure of the mass of matter contained by a unit volume."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76282a0d-3287-449b-8c27-bc11e68ee806",
                                                "sense_id": "08720895-cbea-3048-9ae0-112f36b3c05a",
                                                "text": "In the past two years, NASA’s Kepler Space Telescope has located nearly 3,000 exoplanet candidates ranging from sub-Earth-sized minions to gas giants that dwarf our own Jupiter. Their densities range from that of styrofoam to iron."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4ff20225-0866-4b41-9435-d664f2372396",
                                                "sense_id": "08720895-cbea-3048-9ae0-112f36b3c05a",
                                                "text": "The microcannon was seen moving at about a micron per second, it was about 15 microns long, and the high speed photograph was done in water (density of 1 kg/L, viscosity of about 0.001 pascal seconds)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5d7d174d-13ef-40f8-afcf-cc785ec64387",
                                                "sense_id": "08720895-cbea-3048-9ae0-112f36b3c05a",
                                                "text": "Aquafaba was recovered from 10 commercial canned chickpea products and correlations among aquafaba composition, density, viscosity and foaming properties were investigated. Proton NMR was used to characterize aquafaba composition before and after ultrafiltration through membranes with different molecular weight cut offs (MWCOs of 3, 10, or 50 kDa)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "431d6c66-bc01-3e3a-b07e-1409a0108fc8",
                                        "entry_id": "8423399f-12d7-3e30-aab6-031c2c39175b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The ratio of one quantity, representing something of interest, to another quantity representing space, area, or extent in which the thing of interest is distributed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "874cd028-a916-4915-a333-145b506cc6e7",
                                                "sense_id": "431d6c66-bc01-3e3a-b07e-1409a0108fc8",
                                                "text": "The number of particles per unit volume of a specified volume can be considered to be the particle density for the specified volume."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a2aa9c7-0a27-45a7-a429-daa32caecf0c",
                                                "sense_id": "431d6c66-bc01-3e3a-b07e-1409a0108fc8",
                                                "text": "Density, which is genetically linked, deals with the number of strands per square inch on your scalp. Normal density can range from slight to substantial, varying from person to person."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66922e0f-aa5b-483d-ac7f-c6bff385c295",
                                                "sense_id": "431d6c66-bc01-3e3a-b07e-1409a0108fc8",
                                                "text": "It is vital to use proper keyword density because if your density is too low, your SERP's ranking decreases."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b852014-7897-4e62-ba19-d7ec0fce0186",
                                                "sense_id": "431d6c66-bc01-3e3a-b07e-1409a0108fc8",
                                                "text": "Let's say you get a new customer across town and you don't have any other customers over there. You still need to be competitive with price, but it costs too much money to send crews or a serviceman to one account across town. You need to get more customers over there for margins to exceed the costs of going over there. Once you hit a certain density, you're in the black."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ee0169d-270f-31c1-afe5-1227dc68e187",
                                        "entry_id": "8423399f-12d7-3e30-aab6-031c2c39175b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The probability that an outcome will fall into a given range, per unit of that range; the relative likelihood of possible values of a continuous random variable."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4f7f09a5-bce1-34b6-b402-2f406dc3a86f",
                                        "entry_id": "8423399f-12d7-3e30-aab6-031c2c39175b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Stupidity; denseness."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "dated",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
